{"product_id":"appointment-with-death-poirot","title":"Appointment with Death (Poirot)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA repugnant Amercian widow is killed during a trip to Petra...Among the towering red cliffs of Petra, like some monstrous swollen Buddha, sat the corpse of Mrs Boynton. A tiny puncture mark on her wrist was the only sign of the fatal injection that had killed her. With only 24 hours available to solve the mystery, Hercule Poirot recalled a chance remark he'd overheard back in Jerusalem: 'You see, don't you, that she's got to be killed?' Mrs Boynton was, indeed, the most detestable woman he'd ever met...\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 197 x 129\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Agatha Christie\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780008164959\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 259\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803733418137,"sku":"15RB-4-9780008164959","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f38bbee01b0_Appointment_with_Death__Poirot__Agatha_Christie.jpg?v=1760808534","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/appointment-with-death-poirot","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}